==Trivia==
This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} print features {{p|Turtwig}}, {{p|Chimchar}}, {{p|Piplup}}, {{p|Drifloon}}, and {{p|Buneary}}.

===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Supreme Victors|Piplup|121}} from the {{TCG|Supreme Victors}} expansion.
*'''Nap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Revelation|Piloswine|36}} from the {{TCG|Neo Revelation}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

